Raids are unlocked after killing the first Keymaster. Raids feature 4 different boss monsters each with 3 difficulties. The next boss unlocks once you beat the previous one on any difficulty. All 3 difficulties are available from the start. Raid uses a ticket system, you get one every 2 hours, a maximum of 12 per day. The normal difficulty costs 1 ticket, the medium difficulty costs 3 and the hard difficulty costs 10.

The Two Faced Sentinel has a specific mechanic to his fight. He switches between two stances, one where he attacks and can be damaged and one where he stops attacking and can't be damaged. This switch happens every 5 seconds. You can use the timer to see when it happens so you can time your skills.

